🎞️ Dynamic / GIF (Rich)

Send an animation or GIF.

```js
await sock.sendMessage(jid, {
  dynamic: {
    url: 'https://example.com/animation.gif',
    type: 2,        // 1 = IMAGE, 2 = GIF
    version: 1,
    loopCount: 0    // 0 = loop forever
  },
  headerText: 'Animation for you'
