🗺️ Map (Rich)

Send an interactive map with location annotations.

```js
// Single location
await sock.sendMessage(jid, {
  map: {
    centerLatitude: -6.2088,
    centerLongitude: 106.8456,
    latitudeDelta: 0.05,
    longitudeDelta: 0.05,
